# Animal Sanctuary: "{T}: Add {C}." pays for Firdoch Core with two Moxen, and Thought Scour mills Aven Envoy, a Bird card.
# Next turn "{2}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target Bird, Cat, Dog, Goat, Ox, or Snake" takes the Core - a Kindred artifact
# with changeling, every creature type but no creature - since "target Bird" means a permanent with that subtype, creature or
# not (CR 109.2, 205.3m), and the counter is put on it (CR 122.1). The Envoy in the graveyard is refused: with no zone named,
# the target is a permanent on the battlefield (CR 109.2, 115.1).

